Arturo!

610
00:53:06,333 --> 00:53:07,875
Diego!

611
00:53:07,958 --> 00:53:08,958
Diego!

612
00:53:09,917 --> 00:53:11,000
Diego!

613
00:54:07,375 --> 00:54:08,708
Senhor?

614
00:55:23,292 --> 00:55:24,917
Diego!

615
00:56:43,000 --> 00:56:45,125
Não!

